 "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "skywrath_mage_shield_of_the_scion", "name_zh": "天怒法师·天裔之盾", "name_en": "Shield of the Scion", "description_zh": "每次天怒法师用技能对敌方英雄造成魔法伤害时，他都会获得小型的魔法伤害护盾。每个加成状态独立叠加。", "description_en": "Every time Skywrath Mage deals magical damage to an enemy hero with his abilities, he gains a small magic damage barrier. Each buff stacks independently.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["stack_duration", "damage_barrier", "barrier_duration"]}, {"subject": "skywrath_mage_mystic_flare", "name_zh": "天怒法师·神秘之耀", "name_en": "Mystic Flare", "description_zh": "天怒法师操控终极魔力，召唤精准致命的奥术力场毁灭对手。%duration%秒期间对范围内所有敌方英雄造成大量伤害，伤害由所有英雄平摊。", "description_en": "Skywrath Mage uses his ultimate magical ability to conjure a precise and violent mystical field that lays waste to his adversaries. Deals massive damage distributed evenly among any Heroes in the area over %duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["神秘之耀只会作用于英雄。神秘之耀不会对类英雄单位造成伤害。", "神秘之耀在没有敌方英雄时将对敌方非英雄单位造成伤害。", "神秘之耀会立刻摧毁幻象。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "天怒法师施放神秘之耀时，原目标附近%scepter_radius%范围内另一个敌人的位置上也会产生一个神秘之耀。以英雄为首要目标。", "en": "When Skywrath Mage casts Mystic Flare, another Mystic Flare will be created on the position of a different random target enemy within %scepter_radius% range of the original target. Heroes will take priority."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "damage", "damage_interval", "scepter_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "abaddon_death_coil", "name_zh": "亚巴顿·迷雾缠绕", "name_en": "Mist Coil", "description_zh": "亚巴顿以自身的部分生命为代价，释放出一团致命迷雾，可以对敌方单位造成伤害，或者治疗友方单位。", "description_en": "Abaddon releases a coil of deathly mist that can damage an enemy unit or heal a friendly unit at the cost of some of Abaddon's health.", "notes_zh": ["亚巴顿不能使用此技能自杀。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["self_damage", "self_damage_enemy_target", "missile_speed", "damage_heal", "effect_radius", "perform_attack", "damage_percentage_on_perform_attack", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "abaddon_aphotic_shield", "name_zh": "亚巴顿·无光之盾", "name_en": "Aphotic Shield", "description_zh": "召唤黑暗能量环绕友方单位，驱散他们并创造一个全伤害护盾，护盾在消失前能吸收一定量的伤害。护盾消失或被摧毁后将会爆炸，对附近区域的单位造成伤害，伤害值为护盾的最大吸收量。\n\n驱散类型：强驱散", "description_en": "Summons dark energies around an ally unit, dispelling them and creating an all damage barrier that absorbs a set amount of damage before expiring. When the barrier is destroyed it will burst and deal damage equal to the amount it could absorb to an area around it.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel", "notes_zh": ["不论护盾因持续时间结束或吸收足够伤害后被摧毁都将造成最大伤害。", "爆炸将不会对战争迷雾内单位造成伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "会对附近敌人造成吸收伤害的%absorb_to_damage%%%。", "en": "%absorb_to_damage%%% of absorbed damage is dealt to nearby enemies."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "radius", "damage_absorb", "regen", "absorb_to_damage", "absorb_damage_aoe", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "abaddon_frostmourne", "name_zh": "亚巴顿·魔霭诅咒", "name_en": "Curse of Avernus", "description_zh": "亚巴顿打击一个敌人，使其受到寒心诅咒的作用，被减速，并且持续受到伤害，同时所有攻击目标的单位将提升攻击速度。对建筑的持续伤害减少%tower_dps_pct%%%。", "description_en": "Abaddon strikes an enemy, affecting them by a chilling curse, slowing them, causing them to take damage over time, and all attacks against them gain an attack speed boost. Damage over time component to buildings is reduced by %tower_dps_pct%%%.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["slow_duration", "hit_count", "curse_duration", "curse_slow", "curse_attack_speed", "curse_dps", "tower_dps_pct", "curse_interval"]}, {"subject": "abaddon_withering_mist", "name_zh": "亚巴顿·凋零迷雾", "name_en": "Withering Mist", "description_zh": "对敌人造成伤害时会施加凋零迷雾的负面效果，持续%duration%秒。受作用敌人如果血量低于%hp_threshold_pct%%%，那么生命回复会降低%heal_reduction_pct%%%。", "description_en": "Damaging enemies applies the Withering Mist debuff for %duration%s. Affected enemies have their Health Restoration reduced by %heal_reduction_pct%%% if they are below %hp_threshold_pct%%% HP.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["hp_threshold_pct", "heal_reduction_pct", "duration"]}]
